_ticker_2:`🚀 ACTIVE DEMAND: Bamboo Kite Frames Supply to India (1-2 Containers/Month) - PO Active! 🚀`,home_ticker_3:`🏢 VENDOR REQUIREMENT: Bamboo Modular House 4x6m (Rp 70 Million/Unit) - Needed Soon! 🏢`,home_slide1_title:`Global Bamboo Industry Potential: Economic Opportunities and Environmental Impact`,home_slide1_desc:`Data-driven analysis of bamboo industry trends, production, global markets, and its contribution to environmental sustainability and community economy.`,home_slide2_title:`The Future of Green Construction and Material Innovation`,home_slide2_desc:`Laminated bamboo and modular construction emerge as alternatives to conventional materials. Strong, durable, and neutralizing the world's carbon footprint.`,home_slide3_title:`Village Empowerment and Ecological Restoration`,home_slide3_desc:`Through cultivation and development from upstream to downstream, we not only drive the economy but also restore the earth's springs.`,home_hero_btn_analysis:`VIEW ANALYSIS`,home_hero_btn_projects:`EXPLORE PROJECTS`,home_pos_title:`From Indonesia for the Global Bamboo Industry`,home_pos_desc:`Indonesia has great potential in production-based bamboo industry and sustainability, directly connected to global market needs.`,home_data_title:`Production-Based Bamboo Industry Data`,home_data_roi_label:`Industry ROI Estimate`,home_data_roi_note:`(Based on case studies)`,home_data_cap_label:`Production Capacity`,home_data_cap_unit:`Sheets / Day`,home_data_price_label:`Product Price`,home_data_price_unit:`Per Sheet`,home_data_note:`*Note: Data are estimates and may vary depending on location, scale, and business model.`,home_scale_title:`Industries with Global Growth Potential`,home_scale_desc:`Global demand for bamboo material is increasing as an eco-friendly alternative to wood, metal, plastic, yarn, and fossil energy. This industry has opportunities to grow rapidly in construction, manufacturing, textiles, and carbon economy.`,home_model_title:`Bamboo Industry Economic Model`